* @title LPAD and RPAD widen strings and leave long ones intact
* @attribution Ported from Phil Budne's CSNOBOL4 test suite (pad.sno).
* @expect >>>
* hello!!!!!
*      world
* long
* <<<
	OUTPUT = RPAD("hello",10,"!")
	OUTPUT = LPAD("world",10)
	OUTPUT = RPAD("long",2)
END
